 <pre>{@code
    var player = c.getSubject();
    var pos = player.getPosition();

    player.playSound("minecraft:entity.pig.ambient", "voice", pos.x, pos.y, pos.z, 1.0, 0.8);
 }</pre>

Play a sound event only to this player with volume and pitch.

 <pre>{@code
